  "name": "moment contribution",
  "definition": "share of the intact resisting moment (FE/LB/AR at the 7.5 Nm rotation) or force (shear at the 150 N translation) carried by each structure, from the load drop on its removal; median and interquartile distance ('iqr' field) over 32 segments, all levels pooled; % (relative, NOT ROM increase)",
  "unit": "%"
 },
 "source": {
  "short": "Widmer 2020",
  "authors": "Widmer J, Cornaz F, Scheibler G, Spirig JM, Snedeker JG, Farshad M",
